  "description": "Bright, bold, and full of energy — this electric citrus pattern collection is designed to make your projects pop. Featuring stylized lemons, citrus slices, playful florals, and modern geometric accents, each design is created in a clean, high-contrast vector style with a vibrant neon-inspired palette.\nThe set includes four seamless repeating patterns in different background variations (black, pink, yellow, and light), making it easy to mix and match across a wide range of creative projects. The crisp shapes and balanced compositions ensure a polished, professional look both on screen and in print.\nPerfect for fabric, packaging, stationery, branding, scrapbooking, and digital products, these patterns bring a fresh, modern summer vibe to any design.\nWhat you get:\n4 seamless repeating patterns\nHigh-resolution 12 x 12 inch files\nClean, crisp, print-ready designs",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bright, bold, and full of energy — this electric citrus pattern collection is designed to make your projects pop. Featuring stylized lemons, citrus slices, playful florals, and modern geometric accents, each design is created in a clean, high-contrast vector style with a vibrant neon-inspired palette.<br>\nThe set includes four seamless repeating patterns in different background variations (black, pink, yellow, and light), making it easy to mix and match across a wide range of creative projects. The crisp shapes and balanced compositions ensure a polished, professional look both on screen and in print.<br>\nPerfect for fabric, packaging, stationery, branding, scrapbooking, and digital products, these patterns bring a fresh, modern summer vibe to any design.</p>\n<p>What you get:<br>\n4 seamless repeating patterns<br>\nHigh-resolution 12 x 12 inch files<br>\nClean, crisp, print-ready designs</p>",
